# tally 2.1.7 S1 (#93, F11b): the walk runs S to E (E §2), and a walked value of a day after E is a hole
# naming the end it passes, HOLE-POSTRUN `after the run's end` (L §8.1), never the balance at E carried past it.
# Run 2026-01-01 .. 2026-06-30, 100.00 PLN into konto each month: bal at E is 600.00 PLN (a); bal at 2026-08-31 is
# the hole (b); low over 2026-06-01 .. 2026-08-31 is the min of those bals, so the hole too (c, L §5.14.1); low inside
# the run stands (d); bal before S is HOLE-PRERUN (e); a projection to a day after E is the hole (g), one to E stands
# (h). Was (2.1.6): b 600.00, c 500.00, g 600.00, e "konto has no balance before 2026-01-01".
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-18
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input amt: money PLN
input dom: int
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

move pay[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  dom = 10 "s"

ask a: bal(konto, 2026-06-30)
ask b: bal(konto, 2026-08-31)
ask c: low(konto, 2026-06-01 .. 2026-08-31)
ask d: low(konto, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-06-30)
ask e: bal(konto, 2025-12-31)
ask g: bal(konto, 2026-08-31) from 2026-03-01
ask h: bal(konto, 2026-06-30) from 2026-03-01
ask f: flows(konto, 2026-06-01 .. 2026-08-31)
=== expect
a: 600.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-03]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-04]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-05]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-06]
  cut 2026-10-18
b: ?"after the run's end" (konto)
  cut 2026-10-18
c: ?"after the run's end" (konto)
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-03]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-04]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-05]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-06]
  cut 2026-10-18
d: 0.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-03]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-04]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-05]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-06]
  cut 2026-10-18
e: ?"before the run's start" (konto)
  cut 2026-10-18
f: 100.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-06]
  cut 2026-10-18
g: ?"after the run's end" (konto)
  cut 2026-10-18
h: 600.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-02]
  cut 2026-10-18
